              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಖಳನಾಯಕ — khaḷanāyaka — \"a villain\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಿನಿಮಾದ ಕೊನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಖಳನಾಯಕ ಸೋತನು. sinimāda koneyalli khaḷanāyaka sōtanu. At the end of the film the villain lost."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಖಳನಾಯಕರು, khaḷanāyakaru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಖಳ is wicked: the wicked lead of a story or a film."
            }
          ]
        },
