          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಖಳನಾಯಕ (khaḷanāyaka) is borrowed from Sanskrit, a compound of khala, \"a mischievous person\" (CDIAL 3835), and nāyaka, \"a guide, a leader\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
