              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವೀರ — vīra — \"a hero; a brave man\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ವೀರ ಒಬ್ಬನೇ ಹಳ್ಳಿಯನ್ನು ಕಾಪಾಡಿದನು. ā vīra obbanē haḷḷiyannu kāpāḍidanu. That hero saved the village on his own."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ವೀರರು, vīraru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "As an adjective: ವೀರ (vīra) ಯೋಧ, a brave warrior. A heroine is a ವೀರೆ or ವೀರ (vīra) ಮಹಿಳೆ."
            }
          ]
        },
